IELTS.lesson({"test": 1, "part": 2, "title": "Test 1, Part 2 — the long turn", "candidate": "lama", "script": [{"who": "examiner", "text": "Now, I'm going to give you a topic and I'd like you to talk about it for one to two minutes.", "ar": "الآن، سأعطيكِ موضوعاً وأريدكِ أن تتحدّثي عنه مدة دقيقة إلى دقيقتين.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/93e218b519712f7a.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Before you talk you'll have one minute to think about what you're going to say. You can make some notes if you wish. Do you understand?", "ar": "قبل أن تتحدّثي سيكون لديكِ دقيقة واحدة للتفكير في ما ستقولينه. ويمكنكِ تدوين بعض الملاحظات إن أردتِ. هل هذا واضح؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5a7c17f0603cb77a.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Yes, I understand.", "ar": "نعم، واضح.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/97c37df166c2b7ca.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Here is some paper and a pencil for making notes, and here is your topic.", "ar": "هذه ورقة وقلم لتدوين الملاحظات، وهذا موضوعكِ.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/dcc80d495df59156.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "I'd like you to describe a place where you like to spend time.", "ar": "أريدكِ أن تصفي مكاناً تحبّين أن تمضي فيه وقتكِ.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/53bb68870d3346b6.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "You have one minute. I'll tell you when the minute is up.", "ar": "لديكِ دقيقة واحدة. سأخبركِ عندما تنتهي الدقيقة.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/2b1e1b3092896694.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "All right? Remember you have one to two minutes for this. Don't worry if I stop you. I'll tell you when the time is up. Can you start speaking now, please?", "ar": "حسناً؟ تذكّري أن لديكِ دقيقة إلى دقيقتين. لا تقلقي إن أوقفتكِ. سأخبركِ عندما ينتهي الوقت. هل يمكنكِ أن تبدئي الحديث الآن من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/12de1969ab105c17.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I'd like to talk about the library on the fourth floor of the teaching hospital. It's quite a plain room, but I go there three or four times a week.", "ar": "أودّ أن أتحدّث عن المكتبة في الطابق الرابع من المشفى التعليمي. إنها غرفة بسيطة جداً، لكنني أذهب إليها ثلاث أو أربع مرات في الأسبوع.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a62df2fbed78475e.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I usually go between a morning shift and an afternoon lecture, when I've got two hours and nothing to do. At first I went because I had nowhere else to wait. Now I go because I want to.", "ar": "أذهب عادةً بين مناوبة الصباح ومحاضرة بعد الظهر، حين يكون لديّ ساعتان ولا شيء أفعله. في البداية كنت أذهب لأنه لم يكن لديّ مكان آخر أنتظر فيه. أما الآن فأذهب لأنني أريد ذلك.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/3b30bd1351146066.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I don't do very much there, to be honest. Sometimes I read, but usually I just sit by the window with a coffee and I don't study at all. In a hospital that's quite hard to find.", "ar": "لا أفعل الكثير هناك، بصراحة. أقرأ أحياناً، لكنني في الغالب أجلس عند النافذة مع قهوة ولا أدرس أبداً. في المشفى يصعب جداً أن تجد ذلك.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/686bfe7f7e364231.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "The reason I like it is that nobody needs anything from me in that room. Everywhere else in the building someone asks me a question and often I can't answer it.", "ar": "السبب الذي يجعلني أحبّها هو أن لا أحد يحتاج شيئاً مني في تلك الغرفة. في كل مكان آخر في المبنى يسألني أحدهم سؤالاً وغالباً لا أستطيع الإجابة عنه.", "shot": "two", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/8aa275a2934cb47f.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "In the library nobody expects anything, so I can stop for a while.", "ar": "في المكتبة لا يتوقّع أحد شيئاً، فأستطيع أن أتوقّف قليلاً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/304447cc4e538549.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "There's also an old chair by the window, and you can see Mount Qasioun from it on a clear day.", "ar": "هناك أيضاً كرسي قديم عند النافذة، ويمكنكَ أن ترى جبل قاسيون منه في يوم صافٍ.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/a67af81b49e1bfc4.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "We call it Doctor Haddad's chair, because a professor sat in it every afternoon for about twenty years.", "ar": "نسمّيه كرسي الدكتور حدّاد، لأن أستاذاً جلس فيه كل بعد ظهر نحو عشرين سنة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5b00f0b373017677.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "He left before I started and nobody sits in it now. We all sit around it instead, which sounds silly, but I'd be upset if someone used it.", "ar": "لقد رحل قبل أن أبدأ ولا يجلس فيه أحد الآن. نجلس حوله بدلاً من ذلك، وهذا يبدو سخيفاً، لكنني سأغضب لو استخدمه أحد.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/7e8fe500e8f90e6b.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a place where you like to spend time.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>where it is</li><li>how often you go there</li><li>what you do there</li><li>and explain why you like spending time there</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. Do you usually go there alone?", "ar": "شكراً لكِ. هل تذهبين إلى هناك وحدكِ عادةً؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/cae4a93c096a91ce.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Always alone, yes. Two people from my year go as well, but we agreed not to talk in there.", "ar": "دائماً وحدي، نعم. يذهب شخصان من دفعتي أيضاً، لكننا اتفقنا على ألّا نتكلّم هناك.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "f", "voice": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/b77080f9b1eb4e1e.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That is the end of Part Two.", "ar": "شكراً لكِ. بهذا ينتهي القسم الثاني.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/264fec5248fac38c.mp3"}], "boxes": [{"q": "Describe a place where you like to spend time.", "bullets": ["where it is", "how often you go there", "what you do there", "and explain why you like spending time there"], "long": true, "model": "I'd like to talk about the library on the fourth floor of the teaching hospital. It's quite a plain room, but I go there three or four times a week. I usually go between a morning shift and an afternoon lecture, when I've got two hours and nothing to do. At first I went because I had nowhere else to wait. Now I go because I want to. I don't do very much there, to be honest. Sometimes I read, but usually I just sit by the window with a coffee and I don't study at all. In a hospital that's quite hard to find. The reason I like it is that nobody needs anything from me in that room. Everywhere else in the building someone asks me a question and often I can't answer it. In the library nobody expects anything, so I can stop for a while. There's also an old chair by the window, and you can see Mount Qasioun from it on a clear day. We call it Doctor Haddad's chair, because a professor sat in it every afternoon for about twenty years. He left before I started and nobody sits in it now. We all sit around it instead, which sounds silly, but I'd be upset if someone used it.", "why": "hosp. library, 4th fl 3-4 x week, betw. shifts nothing — that's the point nobody needs anything / Dr Haddad's chair"}, {"q": "Do you usually go there alone?", "model": "Always alone, yes. Two people from my year go as well, but we agreed not to talk in there.", "why": ""}], "voices": {"examiner": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "candidate": "piper-en_US-amy-medium-s119"}});
